  {
   "id": "unsealed-the-mare-384922@1.1",
   "gameId": "unsealed-the-mare-384922",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-22T12:55:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update is now live for Unsealed: The Mare, focused on improving clarity, immersion, and making it easier to understand and follow the story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update introduces a new Lore Journal, improved Focus Memory feedback, and additional audio based memory flashbacks, along with various improvements and polish across the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full patch notes can be found further down.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Lore Journal",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A brand new Lore Journal has been added to help you follow the story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sticky Notes are now saved automatically",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discoveries made using Focus Memory are recorded and saved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Revisit everything you've found at any time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Focus Memory Edge Effect",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Makes interactions easier to spot",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Helps during puzzles and exploration",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduces missed clues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Memory Flashbacks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hear memories from the past",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gain deeper insight into the story",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adds to the overall atmosphere",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "More Reactive Teddies",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The teddies feel more alive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Occasional vocal responses when burned",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Subtle behavioral improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements & Polish",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved puzzle clarity and guidance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "General balance adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additional sound design updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New intro sequence for better narrative setup",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various quality of life improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "-- WHATS NEXT? --",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I'm currently experimenting with a new challenge mode, which may come in a future update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Aside from that, I'll continue monitoring feedback and updating the game with improvements to balance, clarity, and overall experience to make the game as fun and immersive as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, watching you play, hearing feedback and input on the gameplay elements and the lore is both super fun and insightful, and something i consistently keep in mind as I work on the game and future updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Below you can find more detailed patch notes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version 1.1.0",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where a certain checkpoint could, in rare cases, fail to unlock properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Lore Journal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Focus Memory edge effect for improved clarity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added memory flashbacks (audio-based)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Teddies now look at the player when burned",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New short intro when starting new game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Teddies may now occasionally react with sounds or voice lines",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new note in Chapter 1 related to teddies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved navigation in certain areas in Chapter 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new sound for locking/unlocking chained doors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved balance in a specific encounter in Chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new audio for the fire memory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved quality of various audio elements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor fixes to intersecting meshes and decals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
